@startuml VickyTruck - Timeline operativo cloud, Oracle/APEX y MQTT
title VickyTruck - Timeline operativo cloud, Oracle/APEX y MQTT

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI

concise "Oracle APEX" as ORA
concise "Backend cloud" as BE
concise "Chofer" as CH
concise "Central" as CE

@0
ORA is Preparando
BE is Esperando
CH is Inicio
CE is Polling

@1
ORA is Sincronizando
BE is Validando

@2
BE is Aprovisionando
CH is Conectando

@3
CH is Publicando
BE is Persistiendo

@4
CE is Actualizando

@5
ORA is Consultando
CE is EnVivo

@6
CH is FallbackREST
BE is Historial

legend right
== Lectura del timeline ==
0. Inicio: estado base de cada actor.
1. Oracle/APEX sincroniza; backend valida y hace upsert.
2. Backend aprovisiona credencial MQTT; chofer la obtiene.
3. Chofer publica ubicacion; backend persiste.
4. Central consume por polling o MQTT directo.
5. Oracle/APEX consulta estado; Central muestra en vivo.
6. Si MQTT falla: chofer usa fallback REST silencioso.
endlegend

@enduml
